NOTICE

The MIT licence above covers the code written for this project: the watcher,
the herdr socket client, icon resolution, label composition and the tests.

It does not extend to the icon map in `config/defaults.yml` or the shape of the
configuration format. Both originate in tmux-nerd-font-window-name by Josh
Medeski (https://github.com/joshmedeski/tmux-nerd-font-window-name), which
publishes no licence file. No licence claim is made over that material here;
it remains Josh's, and it is included with attribution and gratitude. If you
intend to reuse the icon map itself, take it up with upstream.
